<section class="block"><div class="wrap narrow"><h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<div class="note">DRAFT: must be reviewed by a qualified professional for Indian legal, tax and privacy requirements before launch.</div>
<div class="md"><h2>What we collect</h2><p>Name, email, optional phone, the model files you upload, and the details of your orders and quote requests. We collect only what is needed to quote, make and deliver your order.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2><p>To price and produce your order, send you service emails (verification, quotes, order updates), and keep records the law requires.</p>
<h2>Your files</h2><p>Model files are stored privately and are visible only to you and our staff. They are never published or shared.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2><p>You can export your data and ask for deletion from your account page. Some records (such as invoices) may need to be kept for legal reasons.</p>
<h2>Retention</h2><p><em>To be defined by the owner with professional advice.</em></p></div></div></section>
